WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.770
Here’s the whole year in four words.

00:00:02.770 --> 00:00:03.570
Running:

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:06.260
double the last letter after a short vowel.

00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:07.050
Hoping:

00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:08.770
drop the silent e.

00:00:08.770 --> 00:00:10.620
Happiest and carried:

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:12.550
change y to i.

00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:14.830
Look at the end of the base word first.

00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:16.770
It tells you which rule fires.
